# Heavy bundled scenes — keep them OUT of git. >100 MB blobs would be
# rejected by the GitHub Pages branch anyway. Bundles are hosted on
# HuggingFace datasets; index.html links to the HF CDN URL. Patterns use
# ** to recurse into subdirs (scenes/mip_360/*.bitymi etc).
scenes/**/*.bitymi
scenes/**/*.ply
scenes/**/*.npz
scenes/**/*.nat2
scenes/**/*.bc7
# legacy top-level patterns kept for safety
scenes/*.bitymi
